msgctxt "128_Player"
msgid "(I don't got time to go back right now. I need to keep goin' and meet the info dealer.)"
msgstr "(No tengo tiempo para volver ahora. Necesito seguir y reunirme con el informante.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "140_Player"
msgid "(There's a manhole exit here... No need to lift up the heavy lid and get out of here.)"
msgstr "(Una salida de alcantarilla... No hace falta levantar la pesada tapa para salir de aquí)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "152_Player"
msgid "(The manhole lid's in the way and I can't go any further...)"
msgstr "(La tapa de la alcantarilla me impide el paso; no puedo ir por aquí)."

